{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:4:1210501001:1":{"text":"Bols, these people are honored guests of the Carmine Whispers. Treat them with the highest courtesy, and please don't be rude.","source_cn":"波尔斯，这几位都是血薇帮的贵客。按照最高礼遇，好好招待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EB28F0848DC2C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210501002:1":{"text":"Also, word travels fast in Rustport. The Carmine Whispers are willing to turn a blind eye to some things while others... not so much. You're a smart man. I don't need to say anything else, do I?","source_cn":"锈锚港的墙向来是透风的，有些事，血薇帮可以睁一只眼闭一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55D94BB01B771FA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210501003:1":{"text":"Yeah... So, they're all honored guests?","source_cn":"什么？！就他们几个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7448BEDE4C8C926F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210501004:1":{"text":"Even that urchin Sinbad?!","source_cn":"而且连辛巴达那混小子都算数？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC663014C4788DEE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210501005:1":{"text":"He's the one that found our esteemed guests.","source_cn":"他为我们带来了贵客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9FB0CF4F8544BDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210501006:1":{"text":"I'm flattered. I owe everything to <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"抬举我了，我都是沾身边这位<style=stress>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6E9F1B2D7CCA31","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm flattered. I owe everything to <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"I'm flattered. I owe everything to <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"129843","variant_female_record_index":"129844","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210501007:1":{"text":"You all can stay here, and tell Bols if you need anything.","source_cn":"你们安心在这住着，有事吩咐波尔斯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11159E9B375093DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210501008:1":{"text":"Goodbye for now.","source_cn":"再会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73C5FB32FB13011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210501009:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"啧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A9B43BB82240572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume